Trimmed tokenizers for brot's parity tests

Each file here is a copy of a tokenizer.json published on huggingface.co,
cut down by packages/brot/test/gen/trim_parity_tokenizers.py to the
vocabulary, merges and pieces that brot's parity corpora reach. Their
pipelines, added tokens and identifiers are those of the original. Each is
distributed under the licence of its source, as below.

